---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="MentaliZT — Ana Burjack" lang="en">
    <Nav lang="en" activePage="projects" altHref="/proyecto-astro/mentalizt" />

    <section class="project-hero">
        <span class="project-hero-tag">Mobile App</span>
        <h1 class="project-hero-title">MentaliZT</h1>
        <span class="project-hero-subtitle">App to improve mental health and reduce the effects of stress.</span>
        <div class="project-hero-img">
            <img src="/proyecto-astro/files/mentalizt/cover.png" alt="MentaliZT" />
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-overview">
        <h2 class="overview-title">Project Overview</h2>
        <div class="overview-text">
            <p>This project was developed in the context of an intensive bootcamp, where in 5 days we designed an innovative digital solution to improve mental health and reduce anxiety, exploring different formats such as app, web, or wearable.<br /><br />
                The focus was on understanding how stress affects different user profiles, with the goal of creating a useful, empathetic, and easy-to-integrate solution through daily habits and practical actions.
                <br /><br />Additionally, the proposal sought to differentiate itself from existing tools, committed to an intuitive, attractive, and motivating experience that accompanies the user in their emotional wellbeing.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-hero2">
        <div class="project-hero-img"><img src="/proyecto-astro/files/mentalizt/problema-1.jpg" alt="Problem" /></div>
        <div class="project-hero-img"><img src="/proyecto-astro/files/mentalizt/reto-2.jpg" alt="Challenge" /></div>
